{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_01",
      "hash": "9afa4a3aa9c825e6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "妈妈：哇！真可爱呀！\\n是从博士那里拿到的吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_02",
      "hash": "9afa493aa9c82433",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……真的吗？\\n它是你自己捉到的？\\c\\n好厉害啊！\\n我该怎么称呼它呢？\\c\\n……原来如此！\\n它叫[VAR PKNICK(0003)]呀！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0057_poke_01",
      "hash": "57ee1af82b92f090",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "皮～卡丘～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0057_poke_02",
      "hash": "57ee1df82b92f5a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "伊～布伊～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_03",
      "hash": "9afa483aa9c82280",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "妈妈：哇～！非常有精神！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_05",
      "hash": "9afa4e3aa9c82cb2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你们接下来\\n就要踏上冒险的旅途了吧！\\c\\n我早预想到这一天会到来，\\n所以提前为你准备了这个。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0057_sys_01",
      "hash": "f7649187e2f0b6be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从妈妈那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]城镇地图[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0057_sys_02",
      "hash": "f7649087e2f0b50b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0057_mother_04",
      "hash": "9afa4f3aa9c82e65",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "从包包里查看城镇地图，\\n就能知道自己的所在之处了哦。\\c\\n好了，[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n还有[VAR PKNICK(0003)]！路上小心哦！"
    }
  ],
